pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: the same forgery at the i128 representation. `multiply`
% scales in situ at every width tier, so a coefficient that does not fit i64 is
% no protection. Only model: x1=0 x2=1, so `conclusion UNSAT` is false.
f 3 ;
pol 1 0 * 2 + ;
pol 4 3 + ;
output NONE;
conclusion UNSAT : 5 ;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
